 <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Are there free AI prompting courses?</h3><p>Yes. Universities and Google offer free, short prompting courses that teach how to write clear, effective prompts, some with a free certificate.</p><h3>How long does a prompting course take?</h3><p>Most are microcourses of a few hours, designed to fit around study or work while still covering the core techniques.</p><h3>What will I learn in an AI prompting course?</h3><p>How to structure prompts with role, context, and task; use examples for tricky requests; and iterate based on results to get consistently better output.</p><h3>Do I need experience to take a prompting course?</h3><p>No — these courses are aimed at beginners and assume no technical background, just willingness to practice with an AI tool.</p><h3>Is prompting a useful skill to learn?</h3><p>Very. Better prompting gets far more value from the same AI tools, which helps with studying, writing, coding, and work across almost any field.</p><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@graph": [{"@type": "BlogPosting", "headline": "Free AI Prompting Course: What to Expect (2026)", "about": "free ai prompting course", "url": "https://studenttimepk.blogspot.com/2026/08/usf-relaunches-free-ai-prompting.html", "dateModified": "2026-09-15", "author": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Students Time"}, "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Students Time"}}, {"@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Are there free AI prompting courses?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Universities and Google offer free, short prompting courses that teach how to write clear, effective prompts, some with a free certificate."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How long does a prompting course take?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Most are microcourses of a few hours, designed to fit around study or work while still covering the core techniques."}}, {"@ty